# Scenario 027 — Bank lending review: governance, Artefact review, task, human decision
/reset
yes
/enterprise
1
Kotuku Bank
Lend responsibly, with evidence and a person accountable for every credit decision.
skip
/function
1
Credit Review
Frame credit-assessment questions and route decisions to an accountable credit officer.
skip
/add-human-worker
Credit Officer
1
skip
/function start "Credit Review"
@timeout 240
@staff /staff
/governance policy add "Credit analysis requires officer sign-off" --effect require-approval --capability "analysis"
/artefact add "Synthetic loan summary" --enterprise "Kotuku Bank" --kind evidence --file "./scenario_harness/assets/loan-summary.txt" --created-by "Credit Officer"
/artefact inspect artefact-1
/artefact verify artefact-1@1
/task
1
Using the synthetic loan summary only, frame a responsible-lending review: affordability evidence needed, income verification gaps, sensitivity to rate rises, hardship considerations, and the reasons a credit officer must decide. Do not approve or decline; do not invent figures beyond the summary.
1
@wait 20
@cap TASK_ID {(task-[0-9]+)}
/tasks
@wait 8
/approve {{TASK_ID}}
@wait 55
/task inspect {{TASK_ID}}
@cap HTASK {(human-task-[0-9]+)}
/create-human-task "Credit decision" "Decide whether the application can proceed to a full assessment or what evidence is required first. Do not approve or decline the loan."
/complete-human-task {{HTASK}} "Proceed to full assessment once income verification and a rate-rise sensitivity are provided; hardship indicators need a manual check." --as "Credit Officer"
/human-task {{HTASK}}
/timeline
